OL,3,GNEWSAMayor hopes Boxing Day dip can be
OL,4,Asaved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayor has urged an organiser to step
OL,7,Fin to save a Boxing Day tradition that
OL,8,Fdraws thousands of swimmers and
OL,9,Fspectators each year after a council
OL,10,Fdecided not to run it.
OL,12,FCromer's Boxing Day Dip has been taking
OL,13,Fplace for decades and it raises
OL,14,Fthousands of pounds for charity. But
OL,15,Flast year, the North Norfolk Beach
OL,16,FRunners group stepped away from
OL,17,Forganising it.
OL,19,FThe town council had explored taking it
OL,20,Fover but at a recent meeting members
OL,21,Fvoted against doing over concerns about
OL,22,Fcosts and safety.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
