OL,3,GNEWSAMayor hopes Boxing Day dip can be
OL,4,Asaved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrick Bennett, mayor of Cromer, said
OL,7,Fhe hoped a different organiser could be
OL,8,Ffound so it can continue in future
OL,9,Fyears.
